    label: 'Rank decides the ceiling',
    title: 'Your final rank sets the realistic range of services open to you',
    body: 'IAS closes first, then IFS, then IPS, then the wider Group A central services. A candidate with a lower rank on the general list can still land IAS in some cycles if enough higher-ranked candidates chose IPS or IFS instead.',
