  { num: '02', title: 'Additional District Magistrate (roughly 4-9 years)', body: 'You take on district-wide responsibility as deputy to the Collector, usually after five to eight years of field service.' },
  { num: '03', title: 'District Magistrate or Collector (roughly 9-13 years)', body: 'The most visible milestone in an IAS career. You run an entire district: law and order, revenue, disaster response, and every major government scheme rolled out on the ground.' },
