        <div class="feature-card__label">{item.label}</div>
        <div class="feature-card__title">{item.title}</div>
        <p>{item.body}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Source: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_Administrative_Service" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Indian Administrative Service career-structure overview</a> and current reporting on officer deputation and post-retirement moves. IAS officers can also be deputed to private organisations for a fixed tenure under existing cadre rules.
  </p>

